check 1
# Area B (q-diff-combat-a1): monster missiles on the player. Blood Moor
# (warp 2 at frame 4; town allows no combat), seeds pinned, a quill rat
# (monstats 63, normal) poked 6 sub-tiles east and a fallen shaman (58,
# normal) 6 west at frame 30; no input. Their ranged AI (approach to
# range, shoot, flee), the missiles' flight and hits, the player's hit
# reactions and life loss; the shaman's fire. Spec:
# specs/tools/scenario-diff.md.
name combat-monster-missiles
save ScnAma --class ama --expansion
seed 1234
ticks 260
seconds 600
channels state
at 4 poke warp 2
at 30 poke seed-game 0x00001234 666
at 30 poke seed-unit @player 0x00000055 666
at 30 poke spawn 63 @x+6 @y normal
at 31 poke spawn 58 @x-6 @y normal
